    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out the game from our friends!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Find your way around every stunning cutie during the local beauty contest using your skills and charisma in <strong>FURRY Sex Resort</strong>\ud83c\udfdd\ud83d\udd1e!<br><br>You\u2019re taking the role of a bored tourist on vacation who just happens to be a retired professional photographer. There\u2019s a local beauty contest, so you come up with a genius idea - what if you pretend to be an employee helping contestants to promote themselves? Surely, your motives are way beyond that, but all in good time\u2026<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/43038639c686d63a57c40589f830c199.poster.avif?t=1726136119\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/43038639c686d63a57c40589f830c199.webm?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/43038639c686d63a57c40589f830c199.mp4?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Just talking everyone into believing you wouldn\u2019t work - so you\u2019ll have to put in some amount of effort. Find your way around every girl - they\u2019ve got their own personalities, things to worry about and thoughts about you. Guide them, help them, gift and support them in crucial moments and see what happens!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/c90911d949bb3670207e4fddd8c339a8.poster.avif?t=1726136119\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/c90911d949bb3670207e4fddd8c339a8.webm?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/c90911d949bb3670207e4fddd8c339a8.mp4?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You\u2019ll have to get familiar with the place, find yourself some part-time job to stay there longer and pay the rent, get presents for the girls and buy yourself some decent equipment - all while trying to catch up with everyone. They won\u2019t just be staying there waiting for you - everyone\u2019s got his own regimen and things to do, so be attentive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/4a21b745bdc2cab57769e3ebf788eaed.poster.avif?t=1726136119\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/4a21b745bdc2cab57769e3ebf788eaed.webm?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/4a21b745bdc2cab57769e3ebf788eaed.mp4?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>FURRY Sex Resort</strong> \ud83c\udfdd\ud83d\udd1e offers a relaxing and immersive experience buzzing with the atmosphere of summer and fiery girls. It\u2019s about time to leave your name in the history of this hot resort and the lives of everyone you meet - after all, your voice will be the final one to decide who\u2019s the winner!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/49d393bf126a4d6cf7bae91027247033.poster.avif?t=1726136119\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/49d393bf126a4d6cf7bae91027247033.webm?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025790/extras/49d393bf126a4d6cf7bae91027247033.mp4?t=1726136119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visual novel with gameplay elements and free exploration - you decide what happens next!<br></li><li>Five hot and unique girls to get to know - from a shy bookworm sent there by her parents to a local tribal woman.<br></li><li>Hot photoshoots with every contestant - discover every character to the fullest!<br></li><li>High-quality, vivid, live and moving 2D graphics to further enhance your experience.<br></li><li>Unusual story where a brilliant idea meets real-life obstacles to overcome. <br></li><li>Help everyone and then pick the winner yourself - everything depends on you!</li></ul>",
